        {
          "id": 1084572997,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "The wmem keys are generally void*, and the sequence value passed into the function is a pointer (that could be NULL) I suppose calling GINT_TO_POINTER on the value after dereferencing would work for storing it.",
          "author": {
            "id": 6764551,
            "username": "johnthacker",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "John Thacker",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/99c30adacedf45514aaf711ba8a44f56322ebb53e9b550b7e3c9cd83bd6a1408?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/johnthacker"
          },
          "created_at": "2022-08-31T23:23:47.798Z",
          "updated_at": "2022-08-31T23:23:47.798Z",
          "system": false,
          "noteable_id": 174581498,
          "noteable_type": "MergeRequest",
          "project_id": 7898047,
